{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act40side_level_act40side_st03",
  "groupId": "act40side",
  "stageId": "act40side_st03",
  "title": "須問湯",
  "storyCode": "OR-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "377589f5f3458accc049fb4bae7f381108bc1d8f8701e947cbc1f475c032c4a1",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……今夕何夕？\n幽暗的陵墓不見天日，在這片混沌黑暗中，彷彿時間都已靜止。\n距離這裡上一次傳來動靜已經過去多久？\n而這一天，這裡多出了一道聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你留在這裡，很久了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虞先生，上車吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在下還有個不情之請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這位兄弟，行個方便。幫我去那馬路對面的小飯館，買碗白飯，討杯茶水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要入大獄，也不好空著肚子去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "分內的事，您稍等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "判決已下，總不好一直賴在大理寺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道……今日專程，來送送您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你倒是不怨我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然已經知曉事情全貌，又何怨之有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要怨，也只能怨您沒有早些告訴我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若我早些告訴你，恐怕現在你也得戴上這副鐐銬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總要為大理寺留下幾個好人才……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對前輩的定罪，我也提出過異議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實，前輩若是覺得量刑不公，大可申請三法司復審——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道你覺得，我的所作所為，擔不起這十年牢獄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可您做的這一切，終究是為了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "法就是法，不是“道義”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今日的虞澄若不服法，將來又會有多少個虞澄，為了他們各自的“道義”，造成多少亂事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還說這樣的蠢話，不像我帶出來的徒弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晚輩失言……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然，要如何讓這個“法”，接近更多人心中的道義，那就是你們後來人的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會等著……山上的那棵松樹還在，我還等著到時候，你把它砍下來幫我做棺材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，你今日來為我送行，為何不穿大理寺的官服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我辭官了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一道驚雷，能照亮眼前一瞬，但它斷不清世上一切是非黑白與真假善惡。我看不清的事還有很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "山上的那棵青松還在，但到底也只是一棵青松而已。登山人在這棵青松上看到了什麼，還要看登山人自己的心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我會回天師府，再修行一段時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想不明白的事，糊裡糊塗地做下去，總歸做不出名堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "前輩……我最後，還有一事不解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您究竟為何……執意要查太師的案子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……為什麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我整理了這件案子的前後資料，才發現，為這案子付出一切的，不只顧筌一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麟青硯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "顧筌如此尚有動機，可您除了當年奉命釐清大理寺未解決的舊案，與這件案子並無直接關聯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虞先生，幫您買好飯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "餘味居的跑堂說什麼也不肯收錢，還說隨時等著您再到店裡去做客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大理寺官員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奇怪，我也沒說是幫您買的飯啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想起幾十年前，我第一次在飯館裡遇見顧筌的時候，他跟我說什麼“五色令人目盲，五味令人口爽”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我後來才想明白，到底還是因為我這個人目光短淺，舌頭粗鈍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眼中只能見得清白真相，嘴裡只嚥得下清白滋味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "身穿囚服的男人回過頭，望向了大理寺的門匾，望向了藏在門後的決院。\n他躬下身，掬起柏樹下一抔未化的殘雪，撒入碗中，三兩口扒完了飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好滋味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虞澄",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……且去也。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喲，走了這麼遠了，還準備去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……與你何干？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在大炎的地界上撒潑耍渾，還想讓我當看不見？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們這些老東西，我看是傷疤沒好就忘了痛。我們當年能把你們揍一頓，從這片土地上趕出去，現在照樣能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就憑你一人？可笑……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦，想打架？好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你肚子裡裝下了幾片小天地，我倒要看看你和那個畫畫的誰的本事更大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殘山剩水，經得住我幾把火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會為你的挑釁付出代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，就算在這宰了你，你還是能原樣再捏一個出來，沒什麼意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你在找一個退縮的理由，我可以接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "懶得和你囉嗦，在我找到你的本體，徹底幹掉你之前，我還想問你一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是很好奇，那個臭棋簍子到底許了什麼好處，讓你心甘情願聽他使喚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不對……應該說，“你們”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他的謀劃與我無關，我們不過是有些共同目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我要找的，是那個被囚禁在陵墓裡的，可恥的叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是真心想報仇，早就該將祂那些個分身一一殺了，然後等著祂死在和大炎的戰爭裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這麼多年過去了，你所謂的“同族”，這片大地上也不剩幾隻了吧……你到底還是念舊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看在這點“人情味”上，倒不能把你們和野獸等同視之了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……荒唐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不……不對，這也不是你和他合謀的全部理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別以為能騙過我，這麼多年來，炎國一直留著幾雙眼睛在盯著你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天師”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們還惦記著，百灶城下的那個東西……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "睚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯉叔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸他……會在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟著能打聽到的消息，只能找到這裡來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……和他分別這麼多年來，我倒頭一次希望關於他的傳聞是假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是那個傳聞中打遍武林，甚至多次故意傷人的武瘋子，也實在沒辦法想像會有第二個人了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸，為什麼會變成那樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他是這世上第一等的癡人，可越是癡人，心智越不該被動搖的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個聲音？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "槐琥……等一下見到他，千萬要小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許現在只有你能叫醒他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鯉叔……我們走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（難道那把劍，真的是劫數……？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（梁洵啊梁洵……要是槐天裴有個三長兩短，這筆帳就只能記在你的頭上了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "隔著尚遠的一段距離，山洞深處，隱約可見一個魁梧的身影。\n沉重的拳頭不停地砸在岩壁上，在上面留下了點點梅花似的血斑。每一拳落下，都震得整座洞穴搖搖晃晃。\n來人這才意識到，這個“山洞”，竟是被此人一拳一拳打出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘋癲的喃語",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四十年……天下第一……我何時……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘋癲的喃語",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "劍……不可給人……丟了……還是丟了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘋癲的喃語",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女兒……不准傷害我的女兒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸……醒一醒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "差不多能看到百灶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這座驛館，竟也算故地重遊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……怎麼，你們堅持要陪我一同過來，現在卻一言不發？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這裡死去的，皆是我們的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也皆是為了“忠義”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魏公，有人跟隨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好劍法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多年不見，你的劍法與當年已不可同日而語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "影衛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……陳家小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久不見……魏彥吾……舅舅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "暉潔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本以為在龍門做的事，就是你能做出的最愚蠢的決定……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你，還有你帶著的這些人……現在又打算如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你不該在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "難道是文月……告訴了你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是我自己的決定，與他人無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這件事同樣與你無關——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……的確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我從來沒有問過你過去的事，我想那是你的私事，我也無權干涉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這幾年我又去過了許多地方，見過不少沒見過、沒想過的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也想明白了，這世上萬般矛盾，總有一個“公義”可言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "母親的事……姐姐的事……不能說與你的過往無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我想親眼看看，這段糾纏了你一輩子的往事，究竟要怎樣收場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼……原來是夢啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過會夢到祂也不奇怪就是了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人呢……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小大廚從躺椅上跳下來，使勁伸了個懶腰，又努力揉了揉眼睛。\n眼前的廚房還是原來的模樣，鍋碗瓢盆皆在原處。\n忽然間，他像是想起了什麼，匆忙打開櫥櫃，抱出一堆裝著油鹽醬醋的瓶子。\n他小心翼翼地依次將每一味調味料送入口中，眉頭緊鎖，仔細思索。\n過了許久，笑容才在他臉上浮現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還好……還好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是一樣的滋味……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是人是獸，記不記得，好像也沒差嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "世味悠悠，這一路要找的滋味也都算找到了，再往後的事啊……不想了不想了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今朝有味今朝醉，明日愁來明日愁……也沒什麼大不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "餘",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先開張吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
